{"ref":"BDB, גַּת־רִמּוֹן","hw":"גַּת־רִמּוֹן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גַּת־רִמּוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> in Dan <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:45\" href=\"/Joshua.19.45\">Jos 19:45</a>; Levitical city <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:24\" href=\"/Joshua.21.24\">21:24</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:54\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.54\">1 Ch 6:54</a>; site unknown.—<span dir=\"rtl\">גַּת רִמּוֹן</span> in Manasseh <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:25\" href=\"/Joshua.21.25\">Jos 21:25</a> is scribal error; read <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְלְעָם</span>, q.v.","next":"BDB, גִּתִּי²","prev":"BDB, גַּת הַחֵ֫פֶר"}